WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:09.450
Finding jobs with Credara. It suggests roles that fit your experience, runs your searches every day, and follows the companies you care about.

00:00:10.050 --> 00:00:24.110
Open Find jobs and choose Suggest roles. Credara suggests job titles that fit your verified experience, including career changes, with the reason for each. Save a title, and it joins your daily search.

00:00:24.710 --> 00:00:41.910
Under Your searches, add any title of your own, with a location, or remote. Choose Related titles, and Credara also matches other titles employers use for the same work. Each day you open Credara, it checks your searches against new postings at the companies it follows.

00:00:42.510 --> 00:00:53.480
Companies to follow lists the employers whose career sites Credara reads. Star the ones you care most about, or add another company by its name or its careers-page link.

00:00:54.080 --> 00:01:04.360
Today's top 5 shows up to five new postings from those companies, picked for your experience, each with a short reason. Save one, and it goes straight to Jobs.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:15.310
Credara doesn't search the big job boards itself. For those, set your filters once, and Credara opens each site's own search for you, like LinkedIn and Indeed.

00:01:15.910 --> 00:01:21.800
Found a job you like? Video 2 shows how to capture it and build a résumé made for that role.
